WEB SOURCE (the specification — reproduced 1:1; covenant pt 2)
  components/ai/AITCONarration.tsx — the visible Helix AI surface for TrueCostPage (/tco + /analytics/tco). It is
  `withAiFeature('tco-narration', InnerSection)`: an opt-in, read-only narration layered ABOVE the deterministic
  TCO charts (which it never replaces). InnerSection reads useSelectedVehicle (the gating vehicle id), useTranslation,
  and useAiStream({ url: '/ai/analytics/tco/narrate', body: { vehicle_id } }), computes
  haveInputs = vehicleId > 0, and renders the shared AIFeatureCard (header + "Helix" badge + long-form description +
  optional empty hint + "Ask Helix" CTA + AiOutputPanel). Render contract: wired-or-absent (no placeholder buttons);
  CTA disabled = (!canStart || stream==='streaming'); double-submit start() is a no-op while streaming; AiOutputPanel
  shows nothing when idle+empty, the thinking indicator while streaming with no text, the terminal error (red) on
  error, else the delta-accumulated narration. withAiFeature returns null in ai_mode='off' (ADR-015 §I5 hidden-UI).
  i18n strings extracted from source: tco.aiNarration.{title,description,button,badge,noVehicleHint} + the shared
  helix.{askHelix,thinking,errorLabel} + ai.common.errorUnknown. Data sources: useSelectedVehicle, useTranslation,
  useAiStream. Charts/maps: none.

